  "text": "The bulletproof offboarding protocol every mature agency needs to implement. Ending client engagements without a standard system causes missed final invoices, lost intellectual property, and wasted goodwill. Unstructured wrap-ups leave your delivery team confused about final deliverables while executives scramble to collect outstanding payments. Deploy an automated ClickUp template that triggers final Stripe invoicing, transfers asset libraries, and sends an executive exit survey. This protocol eliminates churn stress while securing predictable client referrals.",
